1
00:00:58,079 --> 00:01:00,799
Chickens for sale! Chickens!

2
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:03,479
Fresh vegetables for sale!

3
00:01:03,479 --> 00:01:05,040
That's too expensive. Give me one. Too expensive!

4
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,079
Come take a look!

5
00:01:08,599 --> 00:01:09,400
Do you want one?

6
00:01:09,959 --> 00:01:10,760
I'll take one.

7
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:12,959
It's real sweet!

8
00:01:12,959 --> 00:01:13,760
It's delicious!

9
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,079
I want it.

10
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:18,040
Vegetables! Fresh vegetables!

11
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,040
Come grab one!

12
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,560
Like hell you do!

13
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:27,079
Come on, it's refreshing!

14
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:28,920
Thanks!

15
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:33,640
Mom...

16
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,319
Yang Dongmei!

17
00:01:34,319 --> 00:01:35,799
Look, it's so pretty.

18
00:01:35,799 --> 00:01:36,680
Yang Dongmei!

19
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,319
Pretty.

20
00:01:37,959 --> 00:01:38,760
What're you doing here?

21
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:43,319
What's that you're holding?

22
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,760
Let me see.

23
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,200
Hand it over.

24
00:01:48,079 --> 00:01:48,760
You bought this?

25
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:50,400
He was staring at it the whole way.

26
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,159
It was just ten cents.

27
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,560
Ten cents isn't money?

28
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,799
Ten cents isn't real money to you?

29
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:56,120
Ten cents means nothing to you?!

30
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,840
You're just a Wasteful woman, aren't you?

31
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,040
It's the first time the kid asked for something.

32
00:02:00,519 --> 00:02:01,879
The first time he asks, you buy it, huh?

33
00:02:02,719 --> 00:02:04,200
Are you gonna buy him whatever he wants?

34
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,879
Buy him whatever the hell he asks for?!

35
00:02:05,879 --> 00:02:07,040
You bastard!

36
00:02:07,159 --> 00:02:08,879
Have you no shame in front of everyone?!

37
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,319
Old bastard, lecturing me now, are you?

38
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:13,759
Lecturing me?!

39
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:14,800
Who do you think you are?

40
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:16,840
Dad, are you all right?

41
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:17,960
What're you doing?!

42
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:19,199
I'm your father!

43
00:02:25,759 --> 00:02:27,000
You're my father?

44
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:31,240
Ask your own conscience—

45
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,599
Are you fit to be a father?!

46
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,000
Ever since I was little...

47
00:02:36,479 --> 00:02:37,840
You've beaten me since I was little!

48
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:40,639
Aside from beating people with a stick,

49
00:02:40,639 --> 00:02:42,039
what else did you ever teach me?!

50
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,560
Do you remember?

51
00:02:45,759 --> 00:02:46,479
Ten years old.

52
00:02:46,759 --> 00:02:48,919
I broke your liquor bottle when I was ten.

53
00:02:48,919 --> 00:02:49,800
You took a fire poker,

54
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,719
and beat me so I couldn't move for 3 days!

55
00:02:51,719 --> 00:02:53,120
Three days! Do you remember?!

56
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,800
And today you're acting all respectable!

57
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,560
You're putting on airs in front of me!

58
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:05,280
Back then I thought, fine, just you wait.

59
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,639
Just wait till I grow up.

60
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,159
Well, I'm grown up now!

61
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,120
So what?!

62
00:03:11,039 --> 00:03:11,960
Old bastard!

63
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:12,960
Hit me!

64
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:14,879
I'm right here! Hit me!

65
00:03:15,719 --> 00:03:16,439
Go ahead, hit me!

66
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,120
Dad!

67
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:17,960
Dad, hit me!

68
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,680
I'm begging you, hit me!

69
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,439
Hit me!

70
00:03:22,439 --> 00:03:23,199
Will you hit me or not?!

71
00:03:24,479 --> 00:03:25,840
You're old now.

72
00:03:27,319 --> 00:03:29,159
You should've known this day would come!

73
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:38,120
The miserable life I have today...

74
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,840
is all because of you!

75
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:41,719
Shi Qing!

76
00:03:42,879 --> 00:03:43,520
Have you lost your mind?!

77
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,719
Screw you!

78
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:46,479
Get lost!

79
00:03:47,719 --> 00:03:48,919
All of you, get the hell out!

80
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,960
Let's go, let's go.

81
00:03:50,159 --> 00:03:51,639
You can't mess with him!

82
00:03:51,639 --> 00:03:52,280
Come on, get up.

83
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,319
Get the hell away!

84
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,560
He's no son of yours.

85
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,879
He acts like he's your lord and master!

86
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,840
What're you staring at?!

87
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,360
Scram!

88
00:04:26,879 --> 00:04:27,439
Dad.

89
00:04:54,439 --> 00:04:55,360
Were you okay back there?

90
00:07:43,319 --> 00:07:43,839
Shitou.

91
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:47,519
Yang Dongmei!

92
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,160
What are you sitting around for?

93
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,040
Go cook for me!

94
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:52,839
Hurry up!

95
00:07:54,319 --> 00:07:54,759
Coming!

96
00:07:59,519 --> 00:08:00,199
Village Chief.

97
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:03,160
Working in the fields yourself?

98
00:08:06,839 --> 00:08:09,199
Not the production team days anymore,

99
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:10,839
working collectively.

100
00:08:10,959 --> 00:08:11,879
Don't cry.

101
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,720
With contracting output to households,

102
00:08:14,439 --> 00:08:16,199
you've got to work your own land.

103
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,319
What'll you eat if you don't?

104
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:20,519
I want a divorce.

105
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:26,439
Dongmei.

106
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:29,560
I know you've suffered a lot these years.

107
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,360
That Shi Qing, he's...

108
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,440
He's an animal.

109
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,279
Vicious and stubborn.

110
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,879
If you want a divorce,

111
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:42,080
will he ever agree?

112
00:08:43,519 --> 00:08:44,480
Be good, Shitou.

113
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:46,080
Whatever you do, don't get anyone killed.

114
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,759
Even if someone dies, I want a divorce.

115
00:08:48,279 --> 00:08:49,919
I really can't take it anymore.

116
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:51,480
You're the village chief.

117
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:52,639
You've got to stand up for me.

118
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:54,559
If you won't help,

119
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:56,639
I'll go to the county Women's Federation.

120
00:08:56,639 --> 00:08:57,039
No, no, don't!

121
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,639
Whatever you do, don't go there!

122
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,240
Shitou, stop crying.

123
00:09:01,399 --> 00:09:02,399
How about this?

124
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:07,799
I'll process the paperwork for you first.

125
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:11,600
Everything has to follow procedure now.

126
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,799
Stop crying, Shitou.

127
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,519
Yang Dongmei.

128
00:09:43,399 --> 00:09:44,080
Coming.

129
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:49,000
Village Chief.

130
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,519
I know Shi Qing isn't home.

131
00:09:50,919 --> 00:09:52,039
He went out drinking.

132
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:53,799
Things are looking up.

133
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,960
The county leaders know your situation.

134
00:09:59,519 --> 00:10:00,480
Here's a Letter of introduction,

135
00:10:00,919 --> 00:10:01,639
and a ticket.

136
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,279
You've got to go.

137
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,320
All right, I'm heading out.

138
00:10:23,879 --> 00:10:25,440
No one should have to live like this.

139
00:10:26,039 --> 00:10:27,120
What era are we in?

140
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,399
Treating a woman like this!

141
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:30,279
You don't need to be afraid.

142
00:10:30,919 --> 00:10:32,360
The government has got our backs.

143
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,360
I'll send people to the village right now

144
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:35,799
to get to the bottom of this.

145
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:38,759
Let's see who dares defy the new policies.

146
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:41,360
Don't be afraid.

147
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:44,879
Have you heard?

148
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:46,600
Old Li's ox died.

149
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:48,639
Its eyes rolled back overnight,

150
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,960
and it was foaming at the mouth.

151
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:50,879
What happened?

152
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,279
That was such a good ox.

153
00:10:52,279 --> 00:10:53,720
It was working the fields two days ago.

154
00:10:59,399 --> 00:11:00,080
Over here.

155
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,399
They're from the county.

156
00:11:08,679 --> 00:11:09,480
Let me tell you.

157
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,480
Last time,

158
00:11:12,039 --> 00:11:14,080
I just spoke up for Dongmei a bit,

159
00:11:14,559 --> 00:11:16,080
and our ox got poisoned.

160
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:17,840
If you really want to investigate,

161
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,519
start with this.

162
00:11:19,759 --> 00:11:20,720
I can guarantee you,

163
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:23,200
Shi Qing poisoned our ox.

164
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:25,320
Look.

165
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,039
This is...

166
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,960
This is Director Huang from security.

167
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:28,879
Director Huang.

168
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,399
Hello, sorry to trouble you.

169
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:32,240
Tell us.

170
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,240
Tell us about this guy in your village,

171
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:34,759
this man named Shi.

172
00:11:34,759 --> 00:11:35,840
The one you all call a bully.

173
00:11:36,519 --> 00:11:37,600
He's tough to deal with.

174
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:38,399
Really tough.

175
00:11:38,399 --> 00:11:39,600
Heard he even beat you up?

176
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,360
I spoke up a bit,

177
00:11:41,879 --> 00:11:43,120
and he even beat us.

178
00:11:43,679 --> 00:11:44,519
Are you afraid of him?

179
00:11:45,159 --> 00:11:47,000
It's not that I'm afraid,

180
00:11:48,159 --> 00:11:49,039
but he's more vicious than anyone.

181
00:11:49,679 --> 00:11:52,000
Living right next to him,

182
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,919
being his neighbor,

183
00:11:54,519 --> 00:11:55,480
is this Shi Qing

184
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,960
always abusing his wife?

185
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,240
He beats Dongmei every day.

186
00:11:59,519 --> 00:12:00,399
The kid gets beaten, too.

187
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:01,399
Even the kid gets beaten?

188
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,159
He...

189
00:12:05,559 --> 00:12:06,720
Rat poison is sold in town.

190
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:08,600
Who got it?

191
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,559
A while back,

192
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:25,559
did you sell Aluminum phosphide here?

193
00:12:26,399 --> 00:12:27,320
I didn't break the law!

194
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,360
Did I say you broke the law?

195
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,879
Legally helping Eradicate the Four Pests—

196
00:12:31,879 --> 00:12:32,639
is everyone's duty.

197
00:12:32,639 --> 00:12:33,399
Look at me.

198
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:39,960
Talk.

199
00:12:44,799 --> 00:12:45,639
Half a month ago,

200
00:12:45,879 --> 00:12:46,840
a guy came into the shop.

201
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:48,480
A big, bearded bald guy.

202
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:51,919
He told me he wanted a huge pack.

203
00:12:52,279 --> 00:12:54,600
I suggested a smaller dose,

204
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:56,519
but he insisted on a big bottle.

205
00:12:58,879 --> 00:12:59,559
What's his name?

206
00:13:00,399 --> 00:13:01,000
I don't know.

207
00:13:01,559 --> 00:13:03,519
Heard he's from nearby Shijia Village.

208
00:13:04,519 --> 00:13:05,360
The village bully there.

209
00:13:06,559 --> 00:13:07,120
Bad temper,

210
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:08,039
constantly beats his wife.

211
00:13:08,519 --> 00:13:09,320
How do you know that?

212
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:10,960
Villagers told me.

213
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:18,480
What do you want?

214
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:19,039
You're Shi Qing, right?

215
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:19,519
What is it?

216
00:13:19,519 --> 00:13:20,279
Are you Shi Qing or not?

217
00:13:20,279 --> 00:13:20,879
That's me. What of it?

218
00:13:20,879 --> 00:13:21,679
Come on, sit, sit down.

219
00:13:21,679 --> 00:13:22,360
Gotta talk to you about something.

220
00:13:23,279 --> 00:13:23,799
Having a drink?

221
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:24,559
What are you drinking?

222
00:13:24,759 --> 00:13:25,039
Sit.

223
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,879
Heard you bought a lot of rat poison.

224
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:30,600
So what?

225
00:13:32,519 --> 00:13:33,039
What are you poisoning,

226
00:13:33,039 --> 00:13:33,639
buying that much?

227
00:13:35,399 --> 00:13:36,000
Officer,

228
00:13:36,519 --> 00:13:38,360
what else would you kill with rat poison?

229
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,879
Other than rats,

230
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:41,559
what else could it be for?

231
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:43,240
Besides,

232
00:13:43,559 --> 00:13:44,600
we've got tons of rats at my place,

233
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,919
so I needed to buy more.

234
00:13:45,919 --> 00:13:46,519
Is that a crime?

235
00:13:46,519 --> 00:13:47,320
As it happens,

236
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:49,000
there's a case

237
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:49,720
that needs your cooperation.

238
00:13:49,919 --> 00:13:50,480
Come with us.

239
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:51,679
What case could possibly need me?

240
00:13:57,879 --> 00:13:59,639
That jinx is finally gone!

241
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,879
We ought to celebrate, shouldn't we?

242
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:06,000
Come over for noodles tonight, okay?

243
00:14:06,159 --> 00:14:06,840
Great!

244
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:08,879
All right, all right.

245
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,600
Break it up now, head home, everyone.

246
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:10,919
Go on home, everyone.

247
00:14:10,919 --> 00:14:11,639
Don't worry.

248
00:14:12,879 --> 00:14:14,679
He won't hurt you anymore.

249
00:14:20,519 --> 00:14:23,240
It's not as simple as just one ox.

250
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:24,799
That ox...

251
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:28,039
even though Old Li was tending it,

252
00:14:28,039 --> 00:14:29,879
it still belongs to

253
00:14:30,279 --> 00:14:31,440
the village as public property.

254
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:32,679
By doing this,

255
00:14:32,679 --> 00:14:35,120
he purposely ruined collective property.

256
00:14:35,879 --> 00:14:37,120
And to the village economy,

257
00:14:37,519 --> 00:14:38,440
it's blatant sabotage.

258
00:14:39,279 --> 00:14:41,080
Things have been chaotic lately,

259
00:14:41,879 --> 00:14:43,559
but orders came from above.

260
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:44,840
Strict enforcement across the board.

261
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,080
Rest assured.

262
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:50,559
All right then.

263
00:14:51,799 --> 00:14:52,399
Live well,

264
00:14:52,759 --> 00:14:53,559
and take good care of yourself.

265
00:15:03,399 --> 00:15:03,879
Village Chief...

266
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:05,600
Come over.

267
00:15:06,279 --> 00:15:06,919
Look.

268
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,200
The papers came through.

269
00:15:08,679 --> 00:15:10,240
Just sign and you'll finally be free.

270
00:15:15,919 --> 00:15:16,480
Right?

271
00:15:18,879 --> 00:15:19,399
But...

272
00:15:20,519 --> 00:15:21,639
there's a condition.

273
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:24,240
The third child goes to Shi Qing.

274
00:15:26,159 --> 00:15:27,039
Why should he?

275
00:15:29,759 --> 00:15:32,039
I know you've had it rough these years.

276
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,679
But the third one's a boy.

277
00:15:33,679 --> 00:15:35,279
He's the root of the Shi family.

278
00:15:37,639 --> 00:15:38,519
Besides,

279
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,559
Shi Qing is his real father.

280
00:15:40,639 --> 00:15:41,840
He'll care for him.

281
00:15:42,759 --> 00:15:43,600
Care for him?

282
00:15:44,399 --> 00:15:47,399
He beat me half to death!

283
00:15:47,399 --> 00:15:49,200
How could he ever care for a child?

284
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:50,639
It's different now.

285
00:15:51,279 --> 00:15:52,639
He's behind bars.

286
00:15:52,879 --> 00:15:54,279
Prison will straighten him out.

287
00:15:55,279 --> 00:15:56,039
If he steps out of line,

288
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:57,440
the village will back you up.

289
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:01,840
He'll be in there for years this time.

290
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:04,799
Besides,

291
00:16:06,120 --> 00:16:07,360
he's being reasonable enough.

292
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,919
See, he gave up everything else,

293
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:10,039
and only wants the third boy.

294
00:16:13,559 --> 00:16:14,639
Besides,

295
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:17,159
you're still young.

296
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:20,120
You have to let go.

297
00:16:28,799 --> 00:16:29,399
I'll sign.
